# Optional — legacy one-shot bootstrap for the knowledge-folder picker.
# The preferred way is the in-app welcome screen; your choice is saved to
# ~/.mywiki/config.json. If the config has no folder yet and this is set to
# an existing directory, it is used once and written into the config.
# PROJECT_DIR=""

# Optional — python of the Docling sidecar venv (auto-detected at
# tools/docling/.venv when present). MYWIKI_DISABLE_DOCLING=1 disables it.
# MYWIKI_DOCLING_PYTHON=""
